---
---

<section class="relative bg-[var(--color-bg-offwhite)] py-24 lg:py-32">
  <!-- Wave transition from Programs -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 wave-svg overflow-hidden" style="margin-top:-1px">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="display:block;width:100%;height:40px">
      <path d="M0,24 C180,0 360,36 540,20 C720,4 900,32 1080,16 C1260,0 1360,24 1440,16 L1440,0 L0,0 Z" fill="var(--color-bg-offwhite)"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -right-3 -top-3 w-20 h-20 border-2 border-[var(--color-burgundy)] z-0 hidden lg:block"></div>
          <div class="relative img-tint border-2 border-[var(--color-primary-blue)] z-10">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lasale-director/600/700.jpg" alt="Executive Director" class="w-full h-[400px] lg:h-[520px] object-cover duotone-img" />
            <div class="img-badge">Executive Director</div>
          </div>
          <!-- Floating name card -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 right-6 lg:right-10 bg-[var(--color-bg-offwhite)] p-5 border-2 border-[var(--color-primary-blue)] z-20">
            <div class="font-script text-[var(--color-burgundy)] text-xl leading-none mb-1">No.</div>
            <div class="font-display font-700 text-[var(--color-primary-blue)] text-2xl leading-none mb-2">ED</div>
            <div class="font-body text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/60 leading-snug">Executive Director</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-7">
          <div class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-[var(--color-burgundy)]"></div>
          <span class="font-display font-500 text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-[var(--color-burgundy)]">Director's Preface</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[2.2rem] lg:text-[2.8rem] leading-[1.04] mb-8">
          <span class="drop-cap">S</span>ambutan Direktur Eksekutif
        </h2>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[var(--color-accent-yellow)] pl-6 mb-8">
          <p class="font-body text-[1.08rem] text-[var(--color-ink)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            "Selamat datang di LaSALe. Sejak 1987, kami telah menjadi wadah bagi mahasiswa hukum untuk mengembangkan kompetensi praktis — dari konsultasi hukum masyarakat, simulasi persidangan, hingga literasi hukum nasional."
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-[1.02rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            "Setiap tahun, LaSALe menghadirkan program-program yang dirancang untuk membekali mahasiswa dengan keterampilan praktis yang dibutuhkan di dunia profesional hukum. Kami percaya bahwa pendidikan hukum tidak cukup hanya di ruang kelas."
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-[0.95rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/65 leading-relaxed">
            "Bergabunglah bersama kami. Bersama, kita bangun masa depan praktik hukum Indonesia."
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[var(--color-primary-blue)] flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-display font-700 text-[var(--color-accent-yellow)] text-lg">L</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display font-600 text-[var(--color-primary-blue)] text-[1rem]">Executive Director</div>
            <div class="font-body text-[0.8rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/50">LaSALe FH UI — BEM FH UI 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
